{
  "id": "427",
  "title": "Buying Cold Medicine",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-06-17",
  "synopsis": "Ben goes to the pharmacy to buy some cold medicine.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/764/eced6d3d69f75be751a7ac558e14649c27b96689.mp3?1574950845",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买感冒药\n\n本：您好！我想买感冒药。\n药剂师：好的，请问您是什么症状？\n本：就是喉咙痛，咳嗽，流鼻涕。\n药剂师：有没有发烧？\n本：没有。\n药剂师：这样啊。那您看这个药怎么样？这是我们店里卖得最好的药，它对治喉咙痛和流鼻涕特别有效。\n本：这药有副作用吗？\n药剂师：一般没有。但吃了这个药会比较想睡觉，最好不要开车。\n本：好的，那就拿这个药吧。\n药剂师：好的。这个药1天吃3次，饭后服用。您先试试看，如果没有效果，要尽快去医院哦。\n本：好的，谢谢您！",
    "traditional": "買感冒藥\n\n本：您好！我想買感冒藥。\n藥劑師：好的，請問您是什麼症狀？\n本：就是喉嚨痛，咳嗽，流鼻涕。\n藥劑師：有沒有發燒？\n本：沒有。\n藥劑師：這樣啊。那您看這個藥怎麼樣？這是我們店裡賣得最好的藥，它對治喉嚨痛和流鼻涕特別有效。\n本：這藥有副作用嗎？\n藥劑師：一般沒有。但吃了這個藥會比較想睡覺，最好不要開車。\n本：好的，那就拿這個藥吧。\n藥劑師：好的。這個藥1天吃3次，飯後服用。您先試試看，如果沒有效果，要盡快去醫院哦。\n本：好的，謝謝您！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying Cold Medicine"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：您好！我想买感冒药。",
      "traditional": "本：您好！我想買感冒藥。",
      "pinyin": "běn nín hǎo wǒ xiǎng mǎi gǎn mào yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello! I want to buy cold medicine."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "药剂师：好的，请问您是什么症状？",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：好的，請問您是什麼症狀？",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī hǎo de qǐng wèn nín shì shén me zhèng zhuàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Sure, may I ask what symptoms you have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：就是喉咙痛，咳嗽，流鼻涕。",
      "traditional": "本：就是喉嚨痛，咳嗽，流鼻涕。",
      "pinyin": "běn jiù shì hóu lóng tòng ké sou liú bí tì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I have a sore throat, cough, and runny nose."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "药剂师：有没有发烧？",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：有沒有發燒？",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī yǒu méi yǒu fā shāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Do you have a fever?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：没有。",
      "traditional": "本：沒有。",
      "pinyin": "běn méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "药剂师：这样啊。那您看这个药怎么样？",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：這樣啊。那您看這個藥怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī zhè yàng a nà nín kàn zhè ge yào zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "这是我们店里卖得最好的药，它对治喉咙痛和流鼻涕特别有效。",
      "traditional": "這是我們店裡賣得最好的藥，它對治喉嚨痛和流鼻涕特別有效。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì wǒ men diàn lǐ mài de zuì hǎo de yào tā duì zhì hóu lóng tòng hé liú bí tì tè bié yǒu xiào",
      "english": "Pharmacist: I see. What do you think about this medicine?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is the medicine that we sell the most of. It’s particularly effective against sore throat and runny nose."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "本：这药有副作用吗？",
      "traditional": "本：這藥有副作用嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn zhè yào yǒu fù zuò yòng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Does it have any side effects?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "药剂师：一般没有。但吃了这个药会比较想睡觉，最好不要开车。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：一般沒有。但吃了這個藥會比較想睡覺，最好不要開車。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī yì bān méi yǒu dàn chī le zhè ge yào huì bǐ jiào xiǎng shuì jiào zuì hǎo bú yào kāi chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Not in general. But you could get a bit sleepy from it, so it's best not to drive a car."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "本：好的，那就拿这个药吧。",
      "traditional": "本：好的，那就拿這個藥吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de nà jiù ná zhè ge yào ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright, then I'll take this one."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "药剂师：好的。这个药1天吃3次，饭后服用。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：好的。這個藥1天吃3次，飯後服用。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī hǎo de zhè ge yào 1 tiān chī 1 cì fàn hòu fú yòng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "您先试试看，如果没有效果，要尽快去医院哦。",
      "traditional": "您先試試看，如果沒有效果，要盡快去醫院哦。",
      "pinyin": "nín xiān shì shi kàn rú guǒ méi yǒu xiào guǒ yào jǐn kuài qù yī yuàn o",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Ok. This medicine should be taken three times per day after a meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "First try it out. If it doesn't have any effect, you should go to a hospital as soon as possible."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "本：好的，谢谢您！",
      "traditional": "本：好的，謝謝您！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie nín",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, thank you!"
    }
  ],
